## What shipped

- services/pdf-export/src/template.ts — controlled-document HTML (STO-3): branded
  header (accent rgb(0,101,248) from design-tokens framer values, pinned literal),
  CONTROLLED stamp, QMS Required Document Information block, numbered clauses,
  BC-1 disclaimer from frontMatter.purpose, gap/na/failed blocks distinct,
  HTML-escaping of all tenant-sourced strings. Handles all 4 content kinds
  (manual/clause sections, correlation_matrix, master_list) on the REAL derive.ts
  shapes. White print theme (app UI is dark; a controlled document is not).
  Font: Inter with Helvetica/Arial fallback (chromium-in-Lambda has no Inter).
- services/pdf-export/src/render.ts — PdfRenderFn: puppeteer-core 25.3.0 +
  @sparticuz/chromium 149.0.0, X86_64 (sparticuz is not ARM — sole divergence from
  the ARM default, documented), 2048MB/120s, bundling.nodeModules (binary never
  esbuild-bundled). One browser per invocation, page concurrency 4. PDF cache:
  tenants/<t>/pdf/<docId>-<bodySha12>.pdf — sha of the FETCHED body, cannot serve
  stale; HeadObject skip; fully-cached batches never launch chromium. Tenant key
  guard on every contentKey.
- services/pdf-export/src/export.ts — ExportFn (STO-4): resolves the export set
  from the master-list content (entries + the master list itself; manual entry
  upgraded to its CURRENT latest version), renders via PdfRenderFn, fflate ZIP
  (manual = 00- first), uploads to tenants/<t>/exports/, presigned GET 15 min.
- services/api/src/resolvers/qms.ts — requestImsExport: SQL only (manual latest
  version + master-list candidates), dispatches to ExportFn; typed
  DOCUMENT_NOT_FOUND / EXPORT_SET_NOT_FOUND / relayed ExportFn errors. Resolver
  stayed on qmsDS (no CFN resolver churn; no schema change; no new data source).
- services/api/src/resolvers/m1.ts — publishControlledDocument SEAL hook (STO-5):
  render final PDF → CopyObject → EvidenceVault with PER-OBJECT
  ObjectLockRetainUntilDate = NOW() + m4.retention_policies.retention_years
  (record_type='controlled_document'; default 7y/review_before_disposal row
  seeded if absent) + ObjectLockMode from env (GOVERNANCE dev / COMPLIANCE prod —
  BC-10). m4.records pointer row (retain_until, object_lock_until, s3_object_ref
  — the columns that existed and were never written) commits in the SAME txn as
  the status flip; audit publish AFTER commit. Seal failure → rollback → typed
  SEAL_FAILED (publish blocked). DOCUMENTED EXEMPTION: empty content_ref
  (agent-writeback docs) publishes WITHOUT sealing, audit carries sealed:false +
  reason — blocking would regress the pre-existing M1 publish flow.
- infra: PdfRenderFn + ExportFn in ApiStack; grants scoped to tenants/* on both
  buckets; s3:PutObjectRetention on EvidenceVault only for M1; s3GeneralKey
  encrypt/decrypt (EvidenceVault shares the key); DataStack exports
  evidenceBucketName; stage plumbs evidence props (DataStack deployed FIRST —
  T5 cross-stack-export lesson applied).

